WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

1
00:00:00.130 --> 00:00:01.990
It's almost time to go, but before we do,

2
00:00:01.990 --> 00:00:04.250
we like to leave you with a little something

3
00:00:04.250 --> 00:00:07.301
to take on the go in the Doggy Bag.

4
00:00:07.301 --> 00:00:09.320
(Ross growling and barking)

5
00:00:09.320 --> 00:00:10.752
(audience applauding and cheering)

6
00:00:10.752 --> 00:00:12.670
There he goes.

7
00:00:12.670 --> 00:00:15.300
And today it's an incredible nonprofit

8
00:00:15.300 --> 00:00:18.350
that we featured in the current magazine that I make.

9
00:00:18.350 --> 00:00:20.070
Yes, it has my name on it.

10
00:00:20.070 --> 00:00:23.420
Just a Kind Note is recruiting letter writers

11
00:00:23.420 --> 00:00:25.080
to be part of their movement

12
00:00:25.080 --> 00:00:27.470
to spread kindness one note at a time.

13
00:00:27.470 --> 00:00:29.810 line:15%
And you can sign up with a commitment

14
00:00:29.810 --> 00:00:31.440 line:15%
to write at least three notes a month,

15
00:00:31.440 --> 00:00:33.490 line:15%
and they'll hook you up with addresses

16
00:00:33.490 --> 00:00:36.290
for some people who could really use some kindness,

17
00:00:36.290 --> 00:00:38.930
elderly people, college kids,

18
00:00:38.930 --> 00:00:41.560 line:15%
first responders, small business owners,

19
00:00:41.560 --> 00:00:44.960 line:15%
and it's designed to require no response

20
00:00:44.960 --> 00:00:46.500 line:15%
from those who get the letters.

21
00:00:46.500 --> 00:00:48.770 line:15%
Just kindness with no strings attached.

22
00:00:48.770 --> 00:00:52.970 line:15%
And they've already sent out 18,000 notes, Rossy.

23
00:00:52.970 --> 00:00:55.550 line:15%
Wow, okay, I'm in, I'm in.

24
00:00:55.550 --> 00:00:57.473 line:15%
I know, I wanna do this too.

25
00:00:57.473 --> 00:00:58.880 line:15%
Let's do it.

26
00:00:58.880 --> 00:01:00.010 line:15%
All right, okay.

27
00:01:00.010 --> 00:01:02.690 line:15%
Hopefully, maybe someone will wanna join in

28
00:01:02.690 --> 00:01:04.240 line:15%
on this wonderful cause.

29
00:01:04.240 --> 00:01:06.650 line:15%
And thank you to all our guests for being here

30
00:01:06.650 --> 00:01:07.671 line:15%
at the studio today.

31
00:01:07.671 --> 00:01:09.162 line:15%
And everybody watching at home

32
00:01:09.162 --> 00:01:10.602 line:15%
(audience cheering)
or on the go,

33
00:01:10.602 --> 00:01:12.013 line:15%
we're so honored that you choose

34
00:01:12.013 --> 00:01:13.613 line:15%
to spend your time with us.

35
00:01:13.613 --> 00:01:16.480 line:15%
Take this good energy with you.

36
00:01:16.480 --> 00:01:18.531 line:15%
That's what you take on the go.

37
00:01:18.531 --> 00:01:19.682 line:15%
We'll see you, too.

38
00:01:19.682 --> 00:01:22.265 line:15%
(upbeat music)

